$DATUM 2-Methyl-1-(nitrophenyl)-2-phenylbut-3-en-1-ol (4a) To a reaction vessel
charged with RuBr(CO)3(η 3-C3H5) (4.5 mg, 0.015 mmol, 5 mol%), t-BuPPh2
(10.9 mg, 0.045 mmol, 15 mol%), aldehyde (45.3 mg, 0.30 mmol, 100 mol%)
and allene (78.0 mg, 0.60 mmol, 200 mol%) was added toluene (0.3 mL, 1.0
M) followed by isopropanol (72.1 mg, 1.20 mmol, 400 mol%). The system was
purged with argon gas and the reaction vessel was sealed. The reaction
mixture was allowed to stir at 75 °C for 11 hours, at which point the
reaction mixture was concentrated in vacuo and the residue was purified
by flash column chromatography (SiO2, 95% toluene:5% EtOAc) to furnish
the title compound (74.0 mg, 0.26 mmol, 87%) as yellow oil (2:1 dr).
yellow oil.TLC (SiO2): Rf = 0.53, 90% Toluene, 10% EtOAc. 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3): 8.06 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H of B), 8.02 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 2H of
A), 7.36 -7.19 (m, 14H)*, 6.50 (dd, J = 17.6, 10.9 Hz, 1H of A), 6.21
(dd, J = 17.6, 10.9 Hz, 1H of B), 5.36 (d, J = 10.9 Hz, 1H of A), 5.22
(d, J = 10.9 Hz, 1H of B), 5.14 (m, 3H)*, 5.03 (d, J = 17.6 Hz, 1H of B),
2.30 (d, J = 1.8 Hz, 1H of B), 2.09 (d, J = 3.5 Hz, 1H of B), 1.40 (s, 3H
of B), 1.29 (s, 3H of A). * Signals overlapped 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3):
147.5, 147.3, 147.2, 143.7, 142.8, 142.3, 141.5, 128.7, 128.6, 128.5,
127.5, 127.1, 127.0 (two signals), 122.3, 122.2, 116.3, 115.6, 79.4,
79.2, 50.4, 50.2, 19.5, 19.4. HRMS Calcd. for C17H18NO3 (M+1): 284.1287,
Found: 284.1294. FTIR(neat): 3154, 2983, 2253, 1519, 1348, 912, 744 cm-1
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
