$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Alkoxy-allylation adduct 20: A solution of 14.8 wt % allyl methoxymethyl
ether in toluene (13.4 g, 19.4 mmol) was dissolved in THF (10.3 mL) and
cooled to −70 °C. To the stirring solution was added 1.3 M sec-
butyllithium in cyclohexane (14.0 mL, 18.2 mmol) dropwise over 20 min
then stirred for 30 min. A 1 M solution of
(+)-B-methoxydiisopinocampheylborane in ether (18.8 mL, 18.8 mmol) was
added over 20 min and then stirred for 1H at −70 °C followed by dropwise
addition of boron trifluoride diethyl etherate (2.46 mL, 19.4 mmol). A
solution of aldehyde 19 (1.54 g, 5.06 mmol) in THF (50 mL) was
immediately added dropwise. The reaction mixture was stirred for 3 h at
−70 °C then slowly warmed to rt and stirred overnight. After all
volatiles were removed in vacuo, the crude oil was dissolved in ether (50
mL) at which time 3 N NaOH (aq) (10 mL) and 30% hydrogen peroxide (20 mL)
were added. The heterogeneous mixture was stirred vigorously under reflux
for 3 h. The phases were separated and the aqueous phase was extracted
with ether (3 x 15 mL). The combined organics were dried over MgSO4,
filtered, concentrated in vacuo, and purified via column chromatography
(20% EtOAc/hexanes). 1.97 g of allylic alcohol 20 (4.85 mmol, 96%) as a
colorless oil. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ ppm 7.24 (d, J=8.48 Hz, 2 H)
6.86 (d, J=8.48 Hz, 2 H) 5.56 (ddd, J=17.52, 10.19, 7.82 Hz, 1H) 5.19 (m,
3 H) 4.73 (d, J=6.52 Hz, 1H) 4.59 (d, J=6.52 Hz, 1H) 4.41 (s, 2 H) 3.99
(t, J=7.99 Hz, 1H) 3.88 (d, J=8.15 Hz, 1H) 3.78 (s, 3 H) 3.39 (m, 5 H)
2.86 (br. s., 1H) 2.33 (m, 1H) 1.56 (m, 5 H) 1.21 (m, 6 H) 0.92 (d,
J=6.52 Hz, 3 H); 13C NMR (101 MHz, CDCl3) δ ppm 158.92, 136.55, 134.37,
131.08, 130.58, 129.05, 118.89, 113.57, 94.06, 80.10, 79.86, 72.35,
70.00, 55.61, 55.08, 37.31, 31.86, 29.69, 27.20, 26.18, 20.81, 11.81; IR
(film): 3466 (br), 3075, 2930, 2856, 2787, 2063, 2002, 1881, 1729, 1613,
1586, 1514, 1463, 1362, 1302, 1248, 1209, 1173, 1153, 1098, 1035; [α]22 D
= +53 (c = 0.82, CH2Cl2); MS (ESI) calculated for C24H38O5 M+ : 406.27,
found 406.3.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, dropwise addition of BuLi/cyclohexane (stage 1), Brown
allylation, dropwise addition of BF3-Et2O (stage 3),dropwise addition of
aldehyde/THF (stage 4), slow addition of borone/Et2O (stage 2)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
