$DATUM 1-(2-Phenylethynylcyclopent-1-enyl)-3-trimethylsilylpropyn-1-ol (21). To
a solution of BuLi (0.62 mL, 2.4 M in hexanes) in THF (3.3 mL) at -78°C
was added trimethylsilylacetylene (0.21 mL, 1.5 mmol) and the resultant
reaction was stirred for 20 min. To this solution was added 20 (0.19 g,
0.99 mmol) in THF (3.3 mL) and the reaction stirred for 30 min. The
reaction was diluted with Et2O, poured into saturated , aqueous NH4Cl and
extracted with Et2O (3x). The combined organic layer was dried over
Na2SO4 and purified with flash chromatography 5% Et2O-petroleum ether to
give 21 as a colorless liquid (0.24 g, 81%). 1H-NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ
7.42 (m, 2H), 7.37 (m, 3H), 5.56 (s, 1H), 2.63 (m, 4H), 1.98 (q, 2H, 7.6
Hz), 0.10 (s, 9H); 13C-NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 148.0, 131.5, 128.4, 123.1,
121.8, 103.9, 95.3, 90.4, 84.4, 81.3, 60.5, 37.1, 31.2, 22.2, -0.1; IR
(NaCl, cm-1) 3131, 2924, 2852, 1722, 1603, 1496, 1452, 1401, 1262, 1044;
HRMS m/z (EI/CI) Expected 294.1440 Found 294.1446.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
