$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (2R,4S,5S,6E,10S)-1,4-Bis(allyloxy)-12-(tert-butyldiphenylsilyloxy)-2,6,10-trimethyldodec
-6-en-5-ol and
(2R,4S,5R,6E,10S)-1,4-Bis(allyloxy)-12-(tert-butyldiphenylsilyloxy)-2,6,10-trimethyldodec
-6-en-5-ol (26) To a solution of 8 (895 mg, 1.77 mmol) in dry ether (10
mL), was added a solution of s-BuLi (1.98 mL, 1.76 mmol, 0.89 M in
cyclohexane-n-hexane) at -78 °C under an argon atmosphere. After being
stirred at -78 °C for 45 min, a solution of 7 (289 mg, 1.36 mmol) in dry
ether (5 mL) was added to the mixture. The mixture was stirred at -78 °C
for 19 h. Saturated NH4Claq (10 mL) was added to the mixture, and the
resulting mixture was extracted with AcOEt (3 x 20 mL). The combined
organic extracts were washed with brine (10 mL), dried over MgSO4,
filtered and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by column
chromatography on silica gel (n-hexane : AcOEt = 10:1) to give 26 as a
colorless oil (621 mg, 1.05 mmol, 77%, diastereomeric ratio = 1:1).
