Hz), 0.95 (3H, d, J = 6.8 Hz), 1.04 (9H, s), 1.11-1.23 (1H, m), 1.26-1.51
(4H, m), 1.53-1.69 (5H, m), 1.81-2.11 (3H, m), 3.18-3.32 (2H, m),
