Reductive Cyclization of o-Nitro Baylis-Hillman Acetates
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM O'Dell, David K.; Nicholas, Kenneth M.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2003), 68(16), 6427-6430

