Alkyllithium Addition Reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Huckins, John R.; De Vicente, Javier; Rychnovsky, Scott D.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2007), 9(23), 4757-4760

