needles. Preparation of
(-)-4-[(5R,2E,6E)-1-Oxo-7-phenyl-5-hydroxy-2-methyl-2,6-heptadienyl]morpholine
(77) (Table 12, entry 5) Following Representative Procedure 8, 126 µL
(1.0 mmol) of cinnamaldehyde was combined with 42 mg (0.05 mmol, 0.05
equiv) of bisphosphoramide (R,R)-3, 18 µL (0.1 mmol, 0.1 equiv) of
diisopropylethylamine, 126 µL (1.1 mmol, 1.1 equiv) of SiCl4 and 340 mg
(1.2 mmol, 1.2 equiv) of 72 to yield, after column chromatography (SiO2
(30 g), 3 cm diam., EtOAc (200 mL) to EtOAc/MeOH, 19/1 (150 mL)) 274 mg
(91%) of (-)-77 as a clear oil.17 The ratio of γ/α-addition products was
determined to be >99/1 by 1H NMR (500 MHz) analysis of the crude reaction
mixture. Data for (-)-77: 1H NMR: (500 MHz, CDCl3) 7.36 (dd, J = 7.1,
